# Cloudflare Secrets & Environment Variables for Khawvel Xtra
# For local development with `npm run pages:dev`, use .dev.vars
# For production, set these via:
#   wrangler secret put <KEY>
# or in the Cloudflare Pages Dashboard -> Settings -> Environment Variables.

# 1. Google Gemini API Key (Free tier from aistudio.google.com)
GEMINI_API_KEY=""

# 2. Meta Facebook Graph API
FB_PAGE_ID=""
FB_PAGE_ACCESS_TOKEN=""

# 3. Optional Secret for Cron /sync endpoint protection
CRON_SECRET=""

# 4. Optional NASA API Key (defaults to DEMO_KEY if blank)
NASA_API_KEY=""
